/*!
\mainpage The FEDEM Model Database

\author Knut Morten Okstad

\date @BUILD_DATE@

\section intro Introduction

This is the source code documentation of the FEDEM Model Database,
which is generated by extracting comments from the source code itself.
The code is organized in a comprehensive multi-level C++ class hierachy,
in which each FEDEM mechanism object type is represented by a class.
Common features shared by different object types are then realized
by inheriting a command base class containing those features.

The code also has a C++ API which is defined in the file FedemDB.C
This is an interface wrapping the key modelling functionalities,
such that they can be invoked by application programmers using Python.
*/
